# Genesis melee weapon localization

ent-Katanacursed = Cursed katana
    .desc = Ancient craftwork made with not so ancient plasteel.
ent-KatanacursedShard = Strange shard
    .desc = A small box containing a hypopen. Packaging disintegrates when opened, leaving no evidence behind.
ent-HolySable = holy blade
    .desc = This sacred saber, known as the "Lightbringer Blade", is given to priests who have distinguished themselves in a region with demonic creatures. Forged from mystical metal and tempered with prayers, it emits a light that can strike you down and cleanse you of impurity. The "Lightbringer Blade" represents perseverance and sacred rage in the fight for light against evil.
